s of hair slightly shift, she locks onto targets ahead. Camera rapidly pulls back to reveal 4–5 black-clad armed mercenaries closing in. Without waiting she drops low, launches forward in a single explosive slide, cuts between two enemies. Right hand sweeps in a claw-like arc trailing bright yellow-gold electric claws; left shoulder grazes past the second man. First enemy is thrown sideways with sparks and metal fragments; second staggers from the arc graze. Camera tracks tightly with her, low and fast.\n\n04.00–08.00s\nShe never stops moving. An enemy swings a baton — she ducks under it at the last instant, slides past his arm, plants and springs up into a spinning electric elbow to the ribs. Uses his body as a momentary platform, kicks off, twists in mid-air and lashes a long yellow-gold arc across another enemy’s visor. Lands, immediately kicks off a wall and reverses direction toward a third target. Movements stay low, light, sudden, and continuous — no heavy wind-ups. Camera stays glued to her with fast whip-pans, low tracking shots and sudden close-ups on the electric claw impacts.\n\n08.00–12.00s\nMore enemies appear from corridors and upper platforms. A fist swings toward camera; at the last moment her black-and-yellow armor and a burst of yellow-gold current “wipe” the lens, cutting to her already perched higher up. She drops from above, body compact, arcs swirling around her, lands with a circular electric shockwave that knocks three nearby enemies back. Immediately chains: forward punch with electric trail → low sliding tackle → flip-kick → spinning claw slash → wall-kick rebound into a diving strike. Each hit produces clear sparks, short electric bursts, armor fragments and ground scorch marks. Camera follows aggressively with crash zooms and quick arcs.\n\n12.00–17.00s\nA heavier elite mechanical enemy steps forward. She drops into a low hunting crouch, shoulders rounded, eyes locked. In one continuous sequence she becomes a blur of yellow-gold residual light: dash left → appear behind him → low upward slash → aerial redirect → final straight-line electric claw thrust into his chest. The elite is driven backward through debris. Residual afterimages, sharp electric tear-lines and successive impact sparks mark every pass. Camera stays tight on the continuous motion, only briefly pulling back at the final impact.\n\n17.00–22.00s\nShe uses the environment fully: runs along walls, rebounds off pillars, hangs inverted for a split second, vaults from an enemy’s shoulder, threads narrow gaps. Landing is almost silent, then she explodes outward again. Camera briefly adopts an enemy POV searching for her — empty frame for a beat — then she drops into frame from above, face filling the shot, yellow-gold current flashing past the lens as she strikes.\n\n22.00–27.00s\nRemaining enemies close in simultaneously. She stands centered for half a second as yellow-gold energy lines intensify across her armor. Then she erupts into continuous high-speed motion, spinning and cutting through the group, leaving multiple electric claw trails and residual images. Camera chases her at near-matching speed: low tracking, rapid orbit, sudden push-in to her eyes, then wide pull-back showing the whole chaotic field. Final beat: she appears directly in front of the last elite, delivers one ultra-close, concentrated electric claw strike. A single blinding yellow-gold detonation sends him flying through a structure.\n\n27.00–30.00s\nSmoke, sparks and fading electric particles drift. She stands on elevated debris, slowly raises her head. Residual yellow-gold current contracts along her arms and armor. She turns her head slightly toward camera — cool, confident, slightly arrogant expression. She closes her hand; a final sharp electric snap flashes across the armor. She lunges forward and a black-and-yellow electric streak wipes the frame to black.\n\noverall_soundscape: layered realistic SFX only — high-voltage crackle and sizzle of yellow-gold arcs, short electric bursts on impact, metal-on-metal hits, fabric and armor friction, sharp whooshes of ultra-fast movement, body impacts and debris, light footfalls, brief intense breathing. No music, no score, no non-diegetic sound.\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "title": "文本", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(21, 23, 27, 0.96)", "size": [715.6731485723453, 1142.5703503570523], "pos": [2353.5514347151193, 1412.8679058337405], "id": 20, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 5, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "Image 1 is the character identity reference (exact face, long straight black hair, yellow-and-black high-tech combat armor, body proportions only). Ignore background and expression from the reference; use only identity and costume.\n\nUltra-realistic cinematic CG, 16:9, 30 fps, 30-second high-octane action short. Dark industrial environment with strong metal reflections and high-energy yellow-gold electric highlights. Style is sharp, expensive, and lethal — no cartoon, no soft lightning, no cheap blue electricity. Protagonist is a cool, fierce, extremely agile East Asian woman in form-fitting yellow-and-black tactical armor with black harnesses, armored panels, gloves and boots. She moves with explosive speed, low center of gravity, cat-like lightness and sudden direction changes. Every motion is fluid and continuous.\n\n00.00–04.00s\nExtreme close-up on her face and upper body. Yellow-gold high-energy arcs crackle and flow across the black panels of her armor and forearms. Pupils tighten, ears of hair slightly shift, she locks onto targets ahead. Camera rapidly pulls back to re